OL,3,ABonnie Tyler remembers loved ones in
OL,4,Aposthumous Christmas single
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last song Tyler recorded features
OL,7,Fsleigh bells and angels and an
OL,8,Fad-libbed farewell: "To all,
OL,9,Fgoodnight."
